As a note to this, OSW is Dragon and have been sticking thier noses into Western Wastes/Dragon Necropolis.  Since Verser, Ghall & Nefarius do a ton of hunting/raiding with OSW...they are also pro-dragon faction.<P>That doesn't mean Alpha group has to go that route.  We are pretty self contained, but going forward ( 50+ )...I could see Alpha group maybe joining an OSW raid as a group in Kael or WW or DN.<P>Also...If we do decide to kill in SkyShrine, it doesn't take too many raids deep in Kael to fix your CoV faction.  Just the Yelinak ( King Dragon ) Faction that will probably be pretty hosed.<P>Just think that the sooner we come to a consensius, the better.  We should also just go all out with the faction we chose. Draw the line in the sand and all that. We can have a ton of fun no matter which way we go.<P>--------------------<P>Verser - Bard of the 51st Song
