being as that I have never been past 41st lvl, and don't know the benifits that well, i know you laid them out and all, but they dont mean much to me. I mean we can bank anywhere we want in the free world ( Norath, Kunark ) and with Leaff we can port to the bank, so I dont see that as a reason for our choice.<P>As far as porting into CS and WL, that should be a good desision maker, but there are ways around this. You can run through Kael invis, we did it before. As far as Cobald Scars, invis again. So it seems to ME that the main reason should be the hunting and quests.<P>Well, here is an Idea......<P>Verser, Ghall, and others chose to follow dragons... maybe Alpha group should choose a different direction. This would alow us to do quests in different faction groups then our Higher counterparts, and give the ones who play in Alpha and have higher players the oppertunity to play both sides of the fence so to speak.<P>As far as loot goes...<P>Is there any NO DROP loot that anyone in the Apha group want/need that requires a certain faction to recieve? this could be our deciding factor. Maybe we need to look at the quests and drops as a group and decide what people want/need to get. Which would be a better balance as far as drops/quests for our group.<P>As far as raids with other guilds......<P>this should be a factor also. Are we ever going to go on raids? I think we will eventually. If so, where? you higher ups are our mentors on this one. You have the experience, and have been much further than some of even dream of ever getting. So where do you want to go? somewhere that your characters wouldnt be able to go? or the same places so you will know the area? I think it is up to you on this one, since we dont have the experience in this area.<P>Overall.......<P>I wrote alot. I think basically I want to leave it up to Medec, Brod and Erlas. My reason.. they have been this route before and know many things the rest of us dont. Including possible mistakes they made in some of their decisions. I will follow loyaly in what ever direction our asteamed leaders take me, ad I am only in the game to have fun, be with my friends and control the minds of my enemy.<P>hope this helps....<P>Paul<P>--------------------<P>Gastro Nomical 43 Enchanter<BR>Floot 35 Bard<BR>Faddil Pykil 26 Monk<BR>Ghowen 35 Druid
